WEBVTT

00:10.267 --> 00:11.992
Delicious.
可口的。

00:17.095 --> 00:18.198
Hey, SpongeBob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

00:18.198 --> 00:19.371
Hi, Sandy.
嗨，桑迪。

00:19.371 --> 00:20.819
Nice of ya to drop in.
很高兴你能过来。

00:20.819 --> 00:21.992
Check it out.
一探究竟。

00:21.992 --> 00:24.198
I science'd up
a new invention.
我科学了
一项新发明。

00:24.198 --> 00:26.888
I call it
the Anthropomorphizer.
我称之为
拟人化者。

00:26.888 --> 00:29.060
- Ohh.
- Allow me to demonstrate.
- 哦。
- 请允许我演示一下。

00:29.060 --> 00:33.129
Ahh! Ahh! Ooh.
啊！啊！哦。

00:36.267 --> 00:37.681
- Wow!
- Yay!
- 哇！
- 耶！

00:37.681 --> 00:38.716
both: Yoo-hoo!
两人：哟吼！

00:38.716 --> 00:40.060
Seasoning!
调料！

00:40.060 --> 00:43.405
- Ahh!
- Voila! Instant life.
- 啊！
- 瞧！ Instant life.

00:43.405 --> 00:46.302
both: Ooh! Whoo-hoo!
两人：哦！呼呼！

00:48.233 --> 00:50.543
Thank you. Thank you.
谢谢。谢谢。

00:50.543 --> 00:55.095
Sandy, can it really bring
anything to life?
桑迪，它真的能带来吗？
有什么生活吗？

00:55.095 --> 00:57.164
You can bet the farm on it.
你可以用农场做赌注。

00:57.164 --> 01:03.336
Even a krabby patty?
甚至是蟹肉饼？

01:03.336 --> 01:05.923
Yep. I reckon so.
是的。我认为是这样。

01:12.198 --> 01:14.336
Order up!
赶快下单吧！

01:14.336 --> 01:17.440
It lives!
My Krabby Patty lives!
它还活着！
我的蟹黄派还活着！

01:17.440 --> 01:19.543
My, what odd sensations.
天啊，多么奇怪的感觉啊。

01:19.543 --> 01:23.095
I feel like--
well, like I can feel!
我感觉就像——
好吧，就像我能感觉到的！

01:23.095 --> 01:24.992
That's called livin'.
这就是所谓的活着。

01:24.992 --> 01:26.888
You can walk and talk,
可以边走路边说话

01:26.888 --> 01:31.164
and I reckon you got a few
thoughts up in the ol' bun too.
我想你有一些
老发髻里也有想法。

01:31.164 --> 01:33.750
Hmm, I reckon I do!
嗯，我想我是的！

01:33.750 --> 01:35.647
I can't believe it. A real
krabby patty who can talk,
我简直不敢相信。一个真实的
会说话的克拉比帕蒂，

01:35.647 --> 01:37.336
and I can talk back to it,
and we can talk about
我可以反驳它，
我们可以谈谈

01:37.336 --> 01:38.854
everything we love,
because I never knew
我们所爱的一切，
因为我从来不知道

01:38.854 --> 01:40.785
what krabby patties loved,
but now I can know,
蟹肉饼喜欢什么，
但现在我可以知道，

01:40.785 --> 01:42.578
and it can know what I know,
because I love krabby patties
它可以知道我所知道的，
因为我喜欢蟹肉饼

01:42.578 --> 01:47.060
and I can show you what I love
in Bikini Bottom!
我可以告诉你我喜欢什么
在比基尼底部！

01:47.060 --> 01:49.302
Well, double my cheese.
好吧，我的奶酪加倍。

01:49.302 --> 01:52.888
I'm in.
我进来了

01:52.888 --> 01:55.854
Yahoo!
雅虎！

01:58.578 --> 02:02.543
Welp, I've created life
from nothing but fast food.
韦尔普，我创造了生命
除了快餐之外什么也没有。

02:02.543 --> 02:06.198
I reckon I'm the smartest
squirrel in the world.
我认为我是最聪明的
世界上的松鼠。

02:06.198 --> 02:07.474
Whoa!
哇！

02:07.474 --> 02:08.578
Heh-heh?
呵呵？

02:08.578 --> 02:09.957
Mm?
毫米？

02:09.957 --> 02:11.060
Mm.
毫米。

02:13.923 --> 02:15.233
Ooh! Ugh!
哦！啊!

02:15.233 --> 02:17.198
This is Jellyfish Fields.
这里是水母田。

02:17.198 --> 02:20.129
♪ La-la, la-la-la,
la-la-la, la-la-la, la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦♪

02:20.129 --> 02:23.129
It's where my friends and I
go jellyfishing.
这是我和我的朋友们的地方
去钓水母。

02:23.129 --> 02:24.371
What the?
什么？

02:24.371 --> 02:27.405
Especially new friends
like you.
尤其是新朋友
像你一样。

02:27.405 --> 02:28.509
Ooh.
哦。

02:28.509 --> 02:30.267
And look, Krabby Patty.
瞧，克拉比·帕蒂。

02:30.267 --> 02:33.405
I even brought an extra little
net so you can learn how to--
我什至还额外带了一点
NET，这样你就可以学习如何——

02:34.819 --> 02:35.647
Whoa!
哇！

02:35.647 --> 02:38.129
Oh, you caught me! Ha-ha.
哦，你抓住了我！哈哈。

02:38.129 --> 02:39.198
Ahh! Ahh!
啊！啊！

02:39.198 --> 02:40.198
Ha-ha! Ahh!
哈哈！啊！

02:40.198 --> 02:42.233
Ahhh!
啊啊！

02:42.233 --> 02:43.957
Ew. Drop it.
呃。放下它。

02:43.957 --> 02:46.681
You don't know
where that nasty patty's been.
你不知道
那个讨厌的小馅饼在哪里。

02:46.681 --> 02:52.095
Hey. That nasty
Krabby Patty is my friend.
嘿。那个讨厌的
克拉比帕蒂是我的朋友。

02:52.095 --> 02:53.612
Whoa!
哇！

02:53.612 --> 02:57.957
Whoa-oh-oh! Oof!
哇哦哦！钱币！

02:57.957 --> 03:01.026
both: Ahh! Yeow!
两人：啊！哟！

03:01.026 --> 03:03.750
You need to be more careful,
Krabby Patty.
你需要更加小心，
克拉比·帕蒂。

03:03.750 --> 03:05.992
You can't help it
that you're delicious.
你无能为力
你很好吃。

03:05.992 --> 03:08.336
Oh-ho-ho-ho! Ay-ay-ay!
噢-嗬-嗬-嗬！哎哎哎！

03:13.716 --> 03:15.474
This is Goofy Goober's,
这是高飞·古伯的，

03:15.474 --> 03:18.371
the tastiest ice cream joint
in town.
最美味的冰淇淋店
在城里。

03:18.371 --> 03:20.578
Everyone looks so happy.
每个人看起来都很高兴。

03:20.578 --> 03:22.440
I want to be happy like them, SpongeBob.
我想像海绵宝宝一样快乐。

03:22.440 --> 03:27.164
♪ Oh, I'm a Goofy Goober yeah,
you're a Goofy Goober, yeah ♪
♪ 哦，我是个傻瓜，是的，
你是个傻瓜，是的 ♪

03:27.164 --> 03:28.233
Ooh.
哦。

03:28.233 --> 03:29.302
Yoo-hoo.
哟吼。

03:29.302 --> 03:31.129
Good sir.
好先生。

03:31.129 --> 03:37.681
Your happiest
Gooberberry Sunrise for two.
你最幸福
古伯贝利日出两人份。

03:37.681 --> 03:40.681
Sharing with ourselves
today, are we?
与我们自己分享
今天，我们是吗？

03:40.681 --> 03:44.854
Huh? No, I'm sharing
with my new friend...
啊？不，我正在分享
和我的新朋友...

03:44.854 --> 03:47.543
Krabby Patty!
蟹蟹帕蒂！

03:50.440 --> 03:52.095
Ahh!
啊！

03:52.095 --> 03:54.474
I'll save you.
我会救你的。

03:57.026 --> 03:58.440
Whoa!
哇！

03:58.440 --> 03:59.888
Ugh!
啊!

04:02.854 --> 04:05.923
Come on, Krabby Patty,
we're leaving.
来吧，克拉比帕蒂，
我们要走了。

04:05.923 --> 04:08.750
And I am never coming back
to a place
我再也不会回来
到一个地方

04:08.750 --> 04:13.026
that would eat a customer.
那会吃掉顾客。

04:13.026 --> 04:15.992
K, see you tomorrow.
K，明天见。

04:15.992 --> 04:21.095
Oh, I'm sorry everyone keeps
trying to eat you, Krabby Patty.
哦，对不起大家都保留了
想吃掉你，蟹黄派蒂。

04:21.095 --> 04:24.233
You must be having
the worst day of your life.
你一定有
你一生中最糟糕的一天。

04:24.233 --> 04:25.957
I've gotta say,
我不得不说，

04:25.957 --> 04:27.992
it hasn't been what I thought.
这不是我想的那样。

04:27.992 --> 04:30.681
No matter how many times I jump
in someone's mouth,
不管我跳多少次
在某人的嘴里，

04:30.681 --> 04:33.302
they still won't swallow me.
他们仍然不会吞掉我。

04:34.405 --> 04:38.129
Wait, you were jumping
into their mouths on purpose?
等等，你跳起来了
故意放进他们嘴里吗？

04:38.129 --> 04:41.026
Of course. Doesn't everyone
want to be eaten?
当然。不是每个人
想被吃掉吗？

04:41.026 --> 04:43.543
No way.
At least I don't think so.
决不。
至少我不这么认为。

04:43.543 --> 04:48.509
Well, I want to be eaten,
and I want to be eaten now!
嗯，我想被吃掉，
我现在就想被吃掉！

04:48.509 --> 04:50.612
Wait, no. You can't.
等等，不。你不能。

04:50.612 --> 04:51.923
Oh, yes I can.
哦，是的，我可以。

04:53.129 --> 04:55.474
Krabby Patty, come back!
克拉比帕蒂，回来吧！

04:59.474 --> 05:00.509
Huh?
啊？

05:00.509 --> 05:02.129
Over here, kids.
在这里，孩子们。

05:02.129 --> 05:04.612
I think you're ready
for solid foods.
我想你已经准备好了
用于固体食物。

05:04.612 --> 05:10.681
kids: Ahh!
孩子们：啊！

05:12.647 --> 05:15.198
I won't let them slobber on you.
我不会让他们向你流口水。

05:15.198 --> 05:18.543
kids: Ugh! Oof! Whoa! Ugh!
孩子们：呃！钱币！哇！啊!

05:18.543 --> 05:21.026
Move it, moppet.
移动它，毛孩。

05:21.026 --> 05:23.164
Scram, squirt.
滚开，喷。

05:23.164 --> 05:24.440
Ugh!
啊!

05:29.267 --> 05:31.474
Ahh!
啊！

05:33.578 --> 05:34.750
Ahh!
啊！

05:34.750 --> 05:37.198
- Ugh!
- Ugh!
- 呃！
- 呃！

05:42.440 --> 05:46.095
My babies!
我的宝贝们！

05:46.095 --> 05:47.612
Whoa!
哇！

05:47.612 --> 05:49.336
Oh!
哦！

05:49.336 --> 05:50.647
Ugh!
啊!

05:53.716 --> 05:57.992
Patty, come back!
帕蒂，回来吧！

05:59.992 --> 06:02.785
Well, if I can't get my hands
on a krabby patty,
好吧，如果我拿不到我的手
放在蟹肉饼上，

06:02.785 --> 06:07.164
then at least I can go on
that ski trip I always wanted.
那么至少我可以继续
我一直想要的滑雪之旅。

06:07.164 --> 06:08.785
Huh?
啊？

06:08.785 --> 06:11.992
Never mind.
Skiing is for jerks.
没关系。
滑雪是混蛋的事。

06:11.992 --> 06:15.474
Hey, krabby patty, Over here.
嘿，蟹肉饼，在这里。

06:15.474 --> 06:18.198
I'd like to have a word with...
我想和...说句话

06:18.198 --> 06:19.405
you?
你？

06:25.681 --> 06:29.923
- Eat me! Eat me! Eat me!
- Ahh!
- 吃我吧！吃我吧！吃我吧！
- 啊！

06:29.923 --> 06:33.129
I've gotta fit in here.
Come on.
我必须适应这里。
快点。

06:34.681 --> 06:38.129
There you are.
你就在那里。

06:40.785 --> 06:43.267
Sorry, Plankton.
对不起，浮游生物。

06:43.267 --> 06:45.233
Krabby Patty here thinks
that he wants to--
克拉比帕蒂认为
他想要——

06:45.233 --> 06:46.543
Go away.
离开。

06:46.543 --> 06:49.509
I need to be alone.
我需要一个人呆着。

06:52.957 --> 06:54.923
I don't get it, Krabby Patty.
我不明白，克拉比·帕蒂。

06:54.923 --> 06:57.854
Don't you want to stay with me
and be my friend?
你不想和我在一起吗
做我的朋友吗？

06:57.854 --> 07:00.095
Of course I do, SpongeBob.
我当然知道，海绵宝宝。

07:00.095 --> 07:02.095
But jellyfishing and ice cream,
但是水母和冰淇淋，

07:02.095 --> 07:04.267
well,
they're for people like you.
嗯，
它们适合像你这样的人。

07:04.267 --> 07:05.854
I'm different.
我不一样。

07:05.854 --> 07:08.612
It's like how your purpose
is making people happy
就像你的目的一样
使人们快乐

07:08.612 --> 07:10.198
by feeding them,
通过喂养它们，

07:10.198 --> 07:14.612
my purpose is making people
happy by feeding them me.
我的目的是让人们
我很高兴给他们喂食。

07:14.612 --> 07:16.612
You know what, Krabby Patty?
你知道吗，克拉比帕蒂？

07:16.612 --> 07:18.198
I get it now.
我现在明白了。

07:18.198 --> 07:21.957
And I'm going to help you be
the best meal you can be.
我会帮助你
你能吃到的最好的一餐。

07:21.957 --> 07:25.440
Let's find the perfect mouth
to gobble you up.
让我们找到完美的嘴巴
吞噬你。

07:25.440 --> 07:31.198
Oh, I'm one happy patty!
哦，我是一只快乐的小馅饼！

07:31.198 --> 07:35.440
Auditions are now open
to eat my friend Patty.
试镜现已开放
吃我的朋友帕蒂。

07:37.681 --> 07:39.164
Next, please.
接下来请。

07:42.095 --> 07:46.060
Only I know how to truly savor
a krabby patty.
只有我知道如何真正品味
蟹肉饼

07:46.060 --> 07:48.543
Therefore,
I believe I should have
因此，
我相信我应该有

07:48.543 --> 07:51.164
the distinction of eating you.
吃掉你的区别。

07:51.164 --> 07:52.750
Hmm.
唔。

07:52.750 --> 07:58.543
Ahh.
啊。

07:58.543 --> 08:01.336
Ooh! Ahh! Ohh! Ugh! Ew!
哦！啊！哦！啊!呃！

08:01.336 --> 08:05.750
I think you savored that
last one a little too long.
我想你很喜欢这个
最后一张有点太长了。

08:05.750 --> 08:06.992
Next.
下一个。

08:06.992 --> 08:08.957
Hmph! Well, I never...
哼！嗯，我从来没有...

08:08.957 --> 08:10.405
Heh-heh-heh-heh, heh.
嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿。

08:10.405 --> 08:15.681
Ohh, what a delicious-looking
little man.
哦，多么美味的样子
小男人。

08:15.681 --> 08:18.681
I could chew on you for hours.
我可以咀嚼你几个小时。

08:24.267 --> 08:28.198
Yeah, I think your mouth
is already occupied, mister.
是的，我认为你的嘴
已经有人了，先生。

08:28.198 --> 08:30.026
Ohh.
哦。

08:33.854 --> 08:34.888
both: Next!
两人：下一个！

08:34.888 --> 08:38.888
Ahh!
both: Next!
啊！
两人：下一个！

08:45.095 --> 08:48.336
Next.
下一个。

08:51.647 --> 08:54.440
Hmm?
唔？

08:54.440 --> 08:55.854
Howdy--ohh.
你好——哦。

08:55.854 --> 08:57.509
Why the long faces?
为什么脸这么长？

08:57.509 --> 08:59.440
Aw pickle chips.
噢泡菜片。

08:59.440 --> 09:01.267
All I want is to be eaten.
我想要的只是被吃掉。

09:01.267 --> 09:02.543
Ohh.
哦。

09:02.543 --> 09:05.543
But we just can't find
the perfect mouth.
但我们就是找不到
完美的嘴。

09:05.543 --> 09:08.026
Well... oh!
嗯……哦！

09:08.026 --> 09:11.509
Maybe SpongeBob could give you
the ol' bite and chew.
也许海绵宝宝可以给你
咬和咀嚼。

09:11.509 --> 09:13.612
Mm.
毫米。

09:13.612 --> 09:15.440
Mm-mm-mm.
嗯嗯嗯。

09:15.440 --> 09:16.440
Ahh.
啊。

09:16.440 --> 09:19.957
Great teeth,
好大的牙齿，

09:19.957 --> 09:21.647
healthy tongue...
健康的舌头...

09:25.440 --> 09:27.405
Minty-fresh breath.
薄荷清新口气。

09:27.405 --> 09:30.819
Spread my ketchup,
the perfect mouth.
涂上我的番茄酱，
完美的嘴。

09:30.819 --> 09:32.888
It would be an honor, SpongeBob.
这将是一种荣幸，海绵宝宝。

09:32.888 --> 09:35.578
Oh, no, Krabby Patty.
哦，不，克拉比·帕蒂。

09:35.578 --> 09:37.543
The honor is mine.
荣誉是我的。

09:37.543 --> 09:41.233
Bon appétit, friend.
祝你胃口好，朋友。

09:41.233 --> 09:42.233
Ahh...
啊...

09:42.233 --> 09:43.681
Halt!
停止！

09:45.095 --> 09:46.957
I deserve this patty.
我值得这个肉饼。

09:46.957 --> 09:49.750
I'm clearly the hungriest.
我显然是最饿的。

09:49.750 --> 09:51.888
Wah!
哇！

09:56.302 --> 09:57.647
both: Whoa!
两人：哇！

10:05.026 --> 10:07.198
All this for little old me.
这一切都是为了小老我。

10:07.198 --> 10:11.026
Ha-ha. Why if you'd told me
when I was a lifeless pile
哈哈。为什么如果你告诉我
when I was a lifeless pile

10:11.026 --> 10:14.302
of ingredients
that someday I'd...
成分的
有一天我会...

10:15.371 --> 10:17.371
Huh?
啊？

10:18.647 --> 10:21.474
Welp,
I guess it got what it wanted.
韦尔普，
我想它得到了它想要的。

10:21.474 --> 10:24.785
So, Gary, how was it?
那么，加里，怎么样？

10:26.026 --> 10:28.129
- Wow.
- Halt!
- 哇。
- 停下来！

10:28.129 --> 10:31.026
I blame the squirrel
for this fracas.
我责怪松鼠
为了这场争吵。

10:31.026 --> 10:34.440
She made us turn on each other
with her wicked,
她让我们互相攻击
与她的恶人，

10:34.440 --> 10:36.267
wicked science.
邪恶的科学。

10:37.923 --> 10:40.785
Well, science giveth,
嗯，科学给出，

10:40.785 --> 10:45.647
and science taketh away.
科学带走了。

10:45.647 --> 10:47.612
Take me away, science.
带我走吧，科学。

10:47.612 --> 10:49.336
Yee-haw!
呀呀！

呀呀！